### ───────────── Reglas de negocio ─────────────

### Sesión en el pasado (400 Bad Request)
POST {{classesUrl}}/api/sessions
Authorization: Bearer {{loginInstructor.response.body.$.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "gymClassId": "{{yogaClassId}}",
  "room": "Salón 2",
  "startsAt": "2025-01-01T18:00:00-05:00"
}

### Cupo mayor al aforo de la clase (400 Bad Request)
POST {{classesUrl}}/api/sessions
Authorization: Bearer {{loginInstructor.response.body.$.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "gymClassId": "{{yogaClassId}}",
  "room": "Salón 4",
  "startsAt": "2026-12-02T07:00:00-05:00",
  "capacity": 100
}

### Rango de fechas invertido (400 Bad Request)
GET {{classesUrl}}/api/sessions?from=2026-12-10T00:00:00Z&to=2026-12-01T00:00:00Z
Authorization: Bearer {{loginMember.response.body.$.accessToken}}

### Clase inexistente (404 Not Found)
GET {{classesUrl}}/api/classes/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001
Authorization: Bearer {{loginMember.response.body.$.accessToken}}
